{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0048-s003", "text": "Information om beslutet ges genom tolkning eller översättning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tolkning/narration/resume-20261103T052017809439+0000-2/hb-c12-u0048-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.25408935546875, "generation_seconds": 18.80352879106067, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0049-s001", "text": "Om du själv bokar tolken och betalar tolkningen, kan du anlita en tolk när som helst.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tolkning/narration/resume-20261103T052017809439+0000-2/hb-c12-u0049-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.34002685546875, "generation_seconds": 28.96231617196463, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0050-s001", "text": "Tolken är med på möten mellan dig och myndigheten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tolkning/narration/resume-20261103T052017809439+0000-2/hb-c12-u0050-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.31891156462585, "peak": 0.256805419921875, "generation_seconds": 17.278594863135368, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0050-s002", "text": "Han eller hon tolkar det som du och myndigheten säger.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tolkning/narration/resume-20261103T052017809439+0000-2/hb-c12-u0050-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.255340576171875, "generation_seconds": 22.525735863950104, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0050-s003", "text": "Tolken är antingen på plats eller också kan tolkningen ordnas via telefon eller video.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tolkning/narration/resume-20261103T052017809439+0000-2/hb-c12-u0050-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.350433349609375, "generation_seconds": 28.462213187944144, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0051-s001", "text": "Tolken har som uppgift att tolka det som du och myndigheten säger.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tolkning/narration/resume-20261103T052017809439+0000-2/hb-c12-u0051-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.264678955078125, "generation_seconds": 28.083479460095987, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0051-s002", "text": "Tolken sköter inga andra uppgifter utöver tolkningen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tolkning/narration/resume-20261103T052017809439+0000-2/hb-c12-u0051-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.34521484375, "generation_seconds": 21.9849685060326, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0051-s003", "text": "Han eller hon kan således inte hjälpa dig med annat.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tolkning/narration/resume-20261103T052017809439+0000-2/hb-c12-u0051-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.266876220703125, "generation_seconds": 21.40392864495516, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
